26-11-17T12:26:34.325Z:\n<page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/417b6705ae1f81aabd8bf1130a9b991c\" icon=\"icons/123_pink\">\n<ancestor-path>\n<parent-page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/40fb6705ae1f8067b4e5edb4d2bb8e93\" title=\"\"/>\n<ancestor-2-page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/40fb6705ae1f802f9fc4f40a07e95da7\" title=\"\"/>\n<ancestor-3-page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/3f7b6705ae1f8070abf2e0c02c7006cb\" title=\"Guides and Reference\"/>\n<ancestor-4-page url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/3d8b6705ae1f80cbb0bcf3002920185e\" title=\"Resources\"/>\n</ancestor-path>\n<properties>\n{\"title\":\"PP - Catalog v2 (Working Copy)\"}\n</properties>\n<iconMetadata>{\"type\":\"icon\",\"icon\":{\"name\":\"123\",\"color\":\"pink\"}}</iconMetadata>\n<content>\n<tabs>\n<tab icon=\"üîé\">\nPesquisa\n\n<database url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/417b6705ae1f8156a1eedfb55bcbe3d5\" data-source-url=\"collection://431b6705-ae1f-83db-b71c-0739778f9e1a\" inline=\"true\"></database>\n</tab>\n<tab icon=\"üëï\">\nT√™xtil\n\n<database url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/417b6705ae1f81f6be31e8c7ef54d5d1\" data-source-url=\"collection://431b6705-ae1f-83db-b71c-0739778f9e1a\" inline=\"true\"></database>\n</tab>\n<tab icon=\"üéÅ\">\nBrindes\n\n<database url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/417b6705ae1f81618ba6f519dfb2729b\" data-source-url=\"collection://431b6705-ae1f-83db-b71c-0739778f9e1a\" inline=\"true\"></database>\n</tab>\n<tab icon=\"üß¢\">\nBrindes T√™xtil\n\n<database url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/417b6705ae1f81bb844ce70f04d1a842\" data-source-url=\"collection://431b6705-ae1f-83db-b71c-0739778f9e1a\" inline=\"true\"></database>\n</tab>\n<tab icon=\"üé®\">\nPor personaliza√ß√£o\n\nEscolhe o separador da t√©cnica. Em ¬´Todas as t√©cnicas¬ª, um PP com v√°rias t√©cnicas pode aparecer em v√°rios grupos; s√£o agrupamentos do mesmo perfil, n√£o PPs diferentes. Todas as galerias consultam a mesma base.\n\n<tabs>\n<tab>\nTodas as t√©cnicas\n\n<database url=\"https://app.notion.com/p/417b6705ae1f8139abe1df